              "lineEnd": 1366,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "06407de89fba45149197d95ab757a91f82a8fb680e8235f79876824a78eca17d"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-boundary-misconception",
        "moduleId": "boundary-and-misconception",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "misconception",
        "title": "补充：常见误解与纠正",
        "markdown": "常见误解是开源就等于完全免费、不含任何专有成分。教材用 Ubuntu 这个反例说明：一个以 FLOSS 为主的发行版，仍然可能打包专有驱动、固件和应用。更稳妥的判断方式是看具体组件的来源与授权条款，而不是只凭整个产品的名字下结论。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "tb-ubuntu-caveat",
            "tb-what-is-floss"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "tb-follow-resources",
        "moduleId": "follow-up-and-check",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "other",
        "title": "教材：了解与跟进 FLOSS 的渠道",
        "markdown": "教材给出两类入口。了解 FLOSS 世界最新动态可以访问 OMG! Ubuntu!、Web Upd8、DistroWatch、Planet Debian；浏览与了解 FLOSS 项目可以访问 GitHub Explore、Code Triage、SourceForge、FreshMeat。教材同时提醒，本章撰写于 2003 年，其中一些内容如今可能已经显得古早。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
